{# BJJ Position Single Page Template #}
{# Generates neutral/asymmetric position pages with no top/bottom split #}
{# Input: data (complete JSON for neutral position) #}

---
title: "{{ data.metadata.title }}"
description: "{{ data.metadata.description }}"
---

<!-- Schema Markup - HowTo -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Use {{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip() }}",
  "description": "Complete guide to {{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().lower() }} in BJJ.",
  "step": [
    {%- for transition in data.offensive_transitions[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Execute {{ transition.technique }}",
      "text": "From this position, execute {{ transition.technique }} to transition to {{ transition.target_position }}. Success rate for advanced practitioners: {{ transition.success_rates.advanced }}%.",
      "position": {{ loop.index }}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "totalTime": "PT2M"
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - FAQ from Common Errors -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for error in data.common_errors[:5] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What happens if you {{ error.error.lower() }}?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{ error.consequence }} The correct approach is: {{ error.correction }}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - WebPage -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip() }}",
  "description": "{{ data.metadata.description }}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - Breadcrumbs -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Positions",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Positions/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "{{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip() }}",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Positions/{{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().replace(' ', '-') }}"
    }
  ]
}
</script>

# {{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip() }}

{% for tag in data.metadata.tags %}#{{ tag }} {% endfor %}

> **Neutral Position**: This position has no clear top/bottom distinction - both players have equal opportunities.
>
> **Quick Stats**: Advanced practitioners advance to better positions {{ data.position_metrics.advancement_probability.advanced }}% of the time with proper technique.

---

<section id="state-properties" class="content-section">

## Position Properties

- **State ID**: `{{ data.metadata.state_id }}`
- **Point Value**: {{ data.state_properties.point_value }} (Neutral)
- **Position Type**: {{ data.state_properties.position_type }}
- **Risk Level**: {{ data.state_properties.risk_level }}
- **Energy Cost**: {{ data.state_properties.energy_cost }}
- **Time Sustainability**: {{ data.state_properties.time_sustainability }}

</section>

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

## What is {{ data.metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip() }}?

{{ data.overview }}

</section>

<section id="state-invariants" class="content-section">

## What Defines This Position?

{% for invariant in data.state_invariants -%}
- {{ invariant }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="prerequisites" class="content-section">

## What Do You Need Before This Position?

{% for prereq in data.prerequisites -%}
- {{ prereq }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## Key Principles

{% for principle in data.key_principles -%}
- {{ principle }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="offensive-transitions" class="content-section">

## Available Techniques and Transitions

{% for transition in data.offensive_transitions -%}
### [[{{ transition.technique }}]] → [[{{ transition.target_position }}]]

**Success Rates:**
- Beginner: {{ transition.success_rates.beginner }}%
- Intermediate: {{ transition.success_rates.intermediate }}%
- Advanced: {{ transition.success_rates.advanced }}%

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="defensive-responses" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How to Defend and Counter

{% for response in data.defensive_responses -%}
- **[[{{ response.technique }}]]** → [[{{ response.target_position }}]]{% if response.success_rate %} (Success: {{ response.success_rate }}%){% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="counter-transitions" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Counter Techniques

{% for counter in data.counter_transitions -%}
- **[[{{ counter.technique }}]]** → [[{{ counter.target_position }}]]
  - {{ counter.trigger }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="decision-tree" class="content-section">

## Decision Making from This Position

{% for node in data.decision_tree -%}
**{{ node.condition }}:**
{% for action in node.actions -%}
- Execute **[[{{ action.technique }}]]** → [[{{ action.target }}]] (Probability: {{ action.probability }}%)
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-errors" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Common Mistakes

{% for error in data.common_errors -%}
### {{ loop.index }}. {{ error.error }}

- ❌ **Consequence**: {{ error.consequence }}
- ✅ **Correction**: {{ error.correction }}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-drills" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Training Drills

{% for drill in data.training_drills -%}
### {{ drill.name }}

{{ drill.description }}

{% if drill.duration -%}
**Duration**: {{ drill.duration }}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="optimal-submission-paths" class="content-section">

## Optimal Paths from This Position

{% for path in data.optimal_submission_paths -%}
### {{ path.name }}

`{{ path.path }}`

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="position-metrics" class="content-section">

## Success Rates and Statistics

| Skill Level  | Retention Rate | Advancement Probability | Submission Probability |
|--------------|----------------|-------------------------|------------------------|
| Beginner     | {{ data.position_metrics.retention_rate.beginner }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.advancement_probability.beginner }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.submission_probability.beginner }}% |
| Intermediate | {{ data.position_metrics.retention_rate.intermediate }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.advancement_probability.intermediate }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.submission_probability.intermediate }}% |
| Advanced     | {{ data.position_metrics.retention_rate.advanced }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.advancement_probability.advanced }}% | {{ data.position_metrics.submission_probability.advanced }}% |

